    },
    {
      "id": "z1n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 292,
      "y": 374,
      "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f",
      "text": "• พนักงานตั้ง proxy เอง\n• เห็นว่า “ใครจะไปเว็บไหน”\n• HTTPS เห็นแค่ชื่อโฮสต์",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:01:14.478Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:01:14.478Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "z2",
